---
import Page from "../Page.astro";
import { DOWNLOADS, RELEASE } from "../downloads";
---
<Page title="Download · OpenLeo" description="Download OpenLeo for Mac, Windows or Linux." current="download">
<h1 class="text-[36px] leading-tight font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em]">Download OpenLeo</h1>
<p class="text-[13px] text-ink-3">Free and open source. Pick your system; after that, OpenLeo updates itself. See <a href="./changelog">what's new</a>.</p>
<div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
  {DOWNLOADS.map((d) => (
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-card border border-line bg-surface p-5">
      <div>
        <h2 class="!mt-0 text-[17px] font-semibold">{d.label}</h2>
        <p class="text-[13px] text-ink-3">{d.note}</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="!my-0 text-[13px] text-ink-2">{d.steps.map((s) => <li>{s}</li>)}</ol>
      <a href={d.url} class="mt-auto inline-flex h-9 items-center justify-center rounded-control bg-ink px-4 text-[13px] font-medium !text-page !no-underline hover:opacity-90">Download for {d.label}</a>
    </div>
  ))}
</div>
<p class="mt-2 text-[13px] text-ink-3">After installing, OpenLeo walks you through giving your agents a computer, then you sign in with ChatGPT. Older versions and every file are on <a href={RELEASE}>GitHub</a>.</p>
<p class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4 border-t border-dashed border-line pt-6 text-[13px] text-ink-3"><a href="./">Home</a><a href="./download">Download</a><a href="./blog">Blog</a><a href="./changelog">Changelog</a><a href="./privacy">Privacy</a><a href="./terms">Terms</a></p>
</Page>
